{"root":{"data":{"id":"dfz87m1vtb40","created":1769502290465,"text":"大模型评估ppt"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz87vz58rk0","created":1769502312067,"text":"主要挑战","expandState":"collapse","layout_mind_offset":{"x":72.99999782443024,"y":959.9999794363979}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz87waao6o0","created":1769502312741,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfz87xy01ew0","created":1769502316351,"text":"大模型评估现状","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-39.99999880790716,"y":-498.9999851286416}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz880fwpiw0","created":1769502321788,"text":"为什么评估？","layout_right_offset":{"x":33.99999898672104,"y":58.99999824166292},"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz8foz0xag0","created":1769502923736,"text":"评估是消除不确定性、建立信任的唯一手段。","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz92qws4gw0","created":1769504730329,"text":"选模型（谁更适合）\n\n找短板（哪里需要改）\n\n上线把关（是否稳定可靠）\n\n风险控制（幻觉/偏见/有害内容）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfz8yz2gztk0","created":1769504434631,"text":"什么是“大模型评估框架”","layout_right_offset":{"x":-18.999999433755875,"y":-337.9999899268154}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz91xwphu80","created":1769504667198,"text":"用一套“任务 + 指标 + 流程”衡量模型能力与风险\n\n产出：对比结论 + 问题诊断 + 上线验收依据"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfz8g3p75v40","created":1769502955793,"text":"测试应该怎么做？","layout_right_offset":{"x":25.99999922513939,"y":-82.99999752640736}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz8t5v1mcw0","created":1769503979234,"text":"通用评估的标准流水线"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz950d1asg0","created":1769504907632,"text":"定目标：评什么、用于什么场景","layout_right_offset":{"x":3.7499998323620503,"y":21.2499990500512}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz950d21280","created":1769504907633,"text":"定任务：设计题目/环境，写清成功标准"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz950d2fao0","created":1769504907633,"text":"选指标：正确性、质量、成本、安全"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz950d21400","created":1769504907633,"text":"跑实验：固定设置，多次运行"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz950d26jc0","created":1769504907633,"text":"出报告：分数 + 失败类型 + 改进建议"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95bcjizc0","created":1769504931546,"text":"当前主流评估范式","layout_right_offset":{"x":-1.9999999403953552,"y":-107.9999967813493}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz95ifz4540","created":1769504946991,"text":"静态基准：固定题库，易对比"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95ifzlc00","created":1769504946992,"text":"动态基准：持续更新，更贴近真实"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95ifza400","created":1769504946992,"text":"内在评估：看输出本身好不好"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95ifzd400","created":1769504946992,"text":"外在评估：看对下游应用有没有用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95ifzqw00","created":1769504946992,"text":"单步评测 vs 多步/智能体评测：从“答题”到“做事”"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95r6voqg0","created":1769504966032,"text":"通用评估阶段","layout_right_offset":{"x":59.99999821186077,"y":-102.99999693036114}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfz95vg8o740","created":1769504975306,"text":"准备：数据/任务/规则"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95vg901k0","created":1769504975306,"text":"运行：模型推理（含工具调用/多轮对话）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95vg8rmg0","created":1769504975306,"text":"评分：自动评测 +（可选）人工/裁判"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfz95vg8oc80","created":1769504975306,"text":"汇总：总体结果 + 分项分析"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfz977evtig0","created":1769505079709,"text":"主流任务类型","layout_right_offset":{"x":46.999998599291075,"y":-99.99999701976765}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfzdtadihpk0","created":1769518094608,"text":"通用考试：基础能力（像“高考”）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfzdth7r7vc0","created":1769518109497,"text":"重点：语言理解、知识、推理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdth7rj280","created":1769518109498,"text":"结论：适合“横向排名”，看底座强不强"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdth7rrbk0","created":1769518109498,"text":"常见输出：分数/排行榜"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdtaditwg0","created":1769518094608,"text":"专业考试：行业能力（像“执业资格考试”）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfzdtkgz6ao0","created":1769518116585,"text":"重点：法律/金融/医学/科学/工程/代码等"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdtkgzs9s0","created":1769518116586,"text":"结论：看“在特定行业是否靠谱”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdtkgzna80","created":1769518116586,"text":"常见输出：专业任务通过率 + 专家/规则评审"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdtadis0w0","created":1769518094608,"text":"目标体检：上线门槛（像“体检+压力测试”）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfzdtsww2o80","created":1769518134962,"text":"重点：安全、幻觉（事实性）、鲁棒性、成本"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdtswwk8o0","created":1769518134962,"text":"结论：决定“能不能上线、上线风险多大”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfzdtswwuew0","created":1769518134963,"text":"常见输出：风险触发率、稳定性、审计报告"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfz881ng3k00","created":1769502324420,"text":"实验室研究方向","layout_mind_offset":{"x":546.99998369813,"y":802.999978929759}},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}